`]}),e.jsxs(r,{title:"Llama 3's accuracy forecast held, in one case",children:[e.jsx(t.p,{children:"ARC-Challenge is a set of grade-school science questions. The figure repeats the one on the two-step slide, now with the real 405B model added as a square. In both panels the square lies just beyond the forecast: the model reached a slightly lower NLL than the fitted line predicted and a slightly higher accuracy."}),e.jsxs(t.p,{children:['The authors call the two-step prediction "quite accurate: it only slightly underestimates the final performance of the flagship Llama 3 model" ',e.jsx(a,{id:"llama3-2024",children:"Grattafiori et al., 2024"}),". The report gives this result only in words and in its Figure 4. It publishes no pair of predicted and actual accuracies."]}),e.jsx(t.p,{children:"One model family, one benchmark and one prediction show that the playbook of sweep, fit, extrapolate and measure can work at a scale nobody could rehearse. They do not establish a general law that turns loss into accuracy."})]})]}),e.jsxs(n,{build:!0,title:"The course's bet, resolved",figure:e.jsx(j,{}),figureWidth:"3/5",accent:0,number:"40",steps:"4",children:[e.jsxs(t.ul,{children:[`
